{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37641","headline":"试笔偶书 · 郑谷","name":"试笔偶书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙鸟与山麋，由来性不羁。\n可凭唯在道，难解莫过诗。\n任笑孤吟僻，终嫌巧宦卑。\n秉慵恩地恕，冷澹好僧知。\n华省慙公器，沧江负钓师。\n露花春直夜，烟鼓早朝时。\n世路多艰梗，家风免坠遗。\n殷勤一蓑雨，秪得梦中披。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}